.TH BBFSCHECK 1
.SH NAME
bbfscheck \- filesystem health checking tool
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B bbfscheck
\-\-summary PATH | \-\-inode PATH | \-\-scan PATH
.SH DESCRIPTION
bbfscheck reports filesystem usage, inode usage, and directory scan statistics.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-help
Show help text.
.SH EXAMPLES
.B bbfscheck \-\-summary /
.SH EXIT STATUS
0 on success, non-zero on error.
